 964 001402* 6214          RDF                     / SET UP RETURN CIF CDF INSTRUCTION     /A207
 965 001403* 1377          TAD     (CDF CIF 0)                                             /A207
 966 001404* 3220          DCA     CALSW1          / SAVE INSTRUCTION                      /A207
 967 001405* 1600          TAD I   CALSWAP         / GET ADDRESS OF ROUTINE TO JMS TOO     /A207
 968                       DCA     T1              / SAVE IT                               /A207
undefined       	   	 ^
undefined       	   	 ^
     001406* 3000  
