1280               /
1281               /       CALL:
1282               /
1283               /       JMS     EFCASE
1284               /       TABLE-1 (ADDRESS OF THE TABLE TO COMPARE AGAINST)
1285               /       (ON NO MATCH RETURNS HERE)
1286               /
1287               /       AC ==>  (VALUE TO COMPARE AGAINST)
1288               /
1289               /       THE COMPARE TABLE HAS THE FORMAT OF:
1290               /
1291               /       VALUE;ADDRESS           / VALUE 1 AND ADDRESS TO JUMP TO ON MATCH
1292               /       VALUE;ADDRESS           / VALUE 2 AND ADDRESS TO JUMP TO ON MATCH
1293               /       ...                     / ETC.
1294               /       0                       / TABLE TERMINATOR
1295               /
1296               /       NOTE: THIS SUBROUTINE DESTROYS THE CONTENTS OF AUTO INDEX
1297               /       REGISTERS 6 AND 7
1298               /
