2230 010256  1651          TAD I   CALLAR          / Get address of routine to be called
2231 010257  3312          DCA     CALADD          / store it
2232 010260  2251          ISZ     CALLAR
2233 010261  1651          TAD I   CALLAR          / Get data field to set
2234 010262  3277          DCA     CALCDF          / store it
